The most important sources, in order, are:

1\. The Great Treatise on the Stages of the Path to Enlightenment, Volume I. Particularly pp. 94–96 on meditation preparation, pp. 195–201 on offerings and refuge, and pp. 231–235 on the power of karmic actions. [Read Volume I (PDF)](https://www.theosophy-ult.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/Vol-1-Lamrim-on-Path-to-Enlightenment-Tsong-kha-pa.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com).

